== ui_card "Sortable List Helper"
  p.sp-text-muted <code>ui_sortable_list(url:, **options, &block)</code>
  p.sp-text-muted <code>ui_sortable_item(id, **options, &block)</code>

  h3 Philosophy
  p Managing lists is a core task. This helper abstracts the complexity of <strong>SortableJS</strong> integration.
  ul
    li <strong>Drag & Drop:</strong> Native feel with grip handles.
    li <strong>Persistence:</strong> Automatically POSTs the new order to the backend.
    li <strong>Clean DOM:</strong> Generates semantic <code>ul/li</code> structures.

  h3 Arguments (List)
  table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 2rem;"
    thead style="border-bottom: 2px solid var(--sp-border);"
      tr
        th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem;" Name
        th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem;" Type
        th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem;" Description
    tbody
      tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sp-border);"
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" url
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" String
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" The endpoint that receives the reordered IDs.
      tr
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" block
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" Block
        td style="padding: 0.5rem;" Content containing <code>ui_sortable_item</code> calls.

  h3 Real World Scenarios
  
  h4 1. Todo List
  p A list of items that can be reordered.
  
  .sp-card
    .sp-card__body
      == ui_sortable_list url: "#"
        == ui_sortable_item 1
          span Buy Milk
        == ui_sortable_item 2
          span Walk Dog
      
      pre style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 1rem;"
        code
          | == ui_sortable_list url: "/todos/sort" do
              - todos.each do |todo|
                == ui_sortable_item todo.id do
                  span = todo.title
